<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGAL'S BANCO MELLO SEES HIGHER '97 NET.</title>
<headline>PORTUGAL'S BANCO MELLO SEES HIGHER '97 NET.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Mello SA expects to boost its profitability in 1997, its president Francisco Lacerda said.</p>
<p>&quot;Given the competitiveness of the bank and the improvements in its operational efficiency, our expectations are that it will continue to reinforce sustained its profits throughout 1997,&quot; Lacerda said in a statement.</p>
<p>Earlier, Banco Mello reported a 801 percent increase in first-half profit to 1.379 billion escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
